   309	      "outcome": "inferred: Inferred from sync.Mutex and the call stack: same-breaker State, Counts, Allow, and Execute block on the mutex held by the outer invocation when called synchronously inside one of these hooks. Name simply reads the stored name. [observed-in-code: gobreaker.go:294 (\"cb.mutex.Lock()\"); gobreaker.go:126 (\"mutex      sync.Mutex\"); gobreaker.go:202 (\"return cb.name\"); gobreaker.go:207 (\"cb.mutex.Lock()\"); gobreaker.go:217 (\"cb.mutex.Lock()\"); gobreaker.go:277 (\"cb.mutex.Lock()\"); gobreaker.go:326 (\"if cb.readyToTrip(cb.counts) {\"); gobreaker.go:359 (\"cb.onStateChange(cb.name, prev, state)\")]",
